        "Option D is baseless.", "விருப்பம் D ஆதாரமற்றது.",
        "TNPSC High-Yield Doctrine: The 'Nexus Rule' prevents the executive from using emergency as an umbrella to enact arbitrary laws unrelated to national security.",
